Any monster which has hands and has gotten hold of a key (or
lockpick?) will open locked doors. Mainly important with shopkeepers,
but if you get a shopkeeper killed, you'll have to take away the key
before locking your pet Olog-Hai into the shop or it will let itself
out sooner or later.

