Unwearable armour. Surplus melee weapons. Empty wands. Scrolls. Rings.
Amulets. Various potions. Tools. It's difficult to give an example of
a useless object a monster *will* throw.

Monsters will normally not throw _anything_ that's not considered a
missile weapon. 

